    "enUS": {
      "dialogue": {
        "264353d0252c7f040d7c": "I can tell just by the way you're standing that you're no warrior.  $B$BWhy don't you go do something safe, like read a book.",
        "7ea9a305360d3ba59885": "Stormwind is the pillar of the human race, maintained through strength of will and the edge of a sturdy blade.",
        "b453a60f1a92bb729259": "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew.  The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done.  It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining.  Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?",
        "deb1feb5808b79855e8c": "I require warrior training."
      },
      "name": "Ilsa Corbin",
      "subName": "Warrior Trainer",
      "translationMetadata": {
        "fields": {
